    "reason": "[ev-b01406e79da0] and [ev-56c06982a6c5] show that the clustercleanuppolicies.kyverno.io CRD's storage moves from v2beta1 (true→false) to v2 (false→true) between 1.12.6 and 1.13.0. The change text says existing objects stay stored as v2beta1 until rewritten and that a storage version migration must be run before v2beta1 is removed. That operator step belongs in the migration family with change type migration-required. The name has to include clustercleanuppolicies because other CRDs also change storage version in this release ([ev-5714a6388637], [ev-094d5d8b0291], [ev-d3850c78b94e]).",
